### Pin the runner image version

Runs executed on Scalr-managed agent pools use the account default runner image unless the workspace is pinned to a specific image version.
The `runner_image_version_id` attribute can only be used with Scalr-managed agent pools: it cannot be combined with an `agent_pool_id` that points to a self-hosted agent pool.
Remove the attribute to fall back to the account default.

